{"suttaId":"sn11.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[3191,3204],"vripara":"248"},"segments":{"sn11.2:0.3":"Susīmasuttaṃ","sn11.2:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ.","sn11.2:1.2":"Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi –","sn11.2:1.3":"“bhikkhavo”ti.","sn11.2:1.4":"“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṃ.","sn11.2:1.5":"Bhagavā etadavoca –","sn11.2:2.1":"“Bhūtapubbaṃ, bhikkhave, asurā deve abhiyaṃsu.","sn11.2:2.2":"Atha kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo susīmaṃ [susimaṃ (syā. kaṃ. ka.)] devaputtaṃ āmantesi –","sn11.2:2.3":"‘ete, tāta susīma, asurā deve abhiyanti.","sn11.2:2.4":"Gaccha, tāta susīma, asure paccuyyāhī’ti.","sn11.2:2.5":"‘Evaṃ bhaddantavā’ti kho, bhikkhave, susīmo devaputto sakkassa devānamindassa paṭissutvā pamādaṃ āpādesi.","sn11.2:2.6":"Dutiyampi kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo susīmaṃ devaputtaṃ āmantesi … pe …","sn11.2:2.7":"dutiyampi pamādaṃ āpādesi.","sn11.2:2.8":"Tatiyampi kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo susīmaṃ devaputtaṃ āmantesi … pe …","sn11.2:2.9":"tatiyampi pamādaṃ āpādesi.","sn11.2:2.10":"Atha kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo susīmaṃ devaputtaṃ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi –","sn11.2:3.1":"“Anuṭṭhahaṃ avāyāmaṃ,","sn11.2:3.2":"sukhaṃ yatrādhigacchati;","sn11.2:3.3":"Susīma tattha gacchāhi,","sn11.2:3.4":"mañca tattheva pāpayā”ti.","sn11.2:4.1":"“Alasvassa anuṭṭhātā,","sn11.2:4.2":"na ca kiccāni kāraye;","sn11.2:4.3":"Sabbakāmasamiddhassa,","sn11.2:4.4":"taṃ me sakka varaṃ disā”ti.","sn11.2:5.1":"“Yatthālaso anuṭṭhātā,","sn11.2:5.2":"accantaṃ sukhamedhati;","sn11.2:5.3":"Susīma tattha gacchāhi,","sn11.2:5.4":"mañca tattheva pāpayā”ti.","sn11.2:6.1":"“Akammunā devaseṭṭha,","sn11.2:6.2":"sakka vindemu yaṃ sukhaṃ;","sn11.2:6.3":"Asokaṃ anupāyāsaṃ,","sn11.2:6.4":"taṃ me sakka varaṃ disā”ti.","sn11.2:7.1":"“Sace atthi akammena,","sn11.2:7.2":"koci kvaci na jīvati;","sn11.2:7.3":"Nibbānassa hi so maggo,","sn11.2:7.4":"susīma tattha gacchāhi;","sn11.2:7.5":"Mañca tattheva pāpayā”ti.","sn11.2:8.1":"“So hi nāma, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo sakaṃ puññaphalaṃ upajīvamāno devānaṃ tāvatiṃsānaṃ issariyādhipaccaṃ rajjaṃ kārento uṭṭhānavīriyassa vaṇṇavādī bhavissati.","sn11.2:8.2":"Idha kho taṃ, bhikkhave, sobhetha, yaṃ tumhe evaṃ svākkhāte dhammavinaye pabbajitā samānā uṭṭhaheyyātha ghaṭeyyātha vāyameyyātha appattassa pattiyā, anadhigatassa adhigamāya, asacchikatassa sacchikiriyāyā”ti."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":1413,"to":1413,"paras":[{"para":1413,"vripara":"248","refs":["sn11.2:2"],"lines":["Dutiye <b>susīman</b>ti attano puttasahassassa antare evaṃnāmakaṃ ekaṃ puttameva.","Dutiyaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn11.2:2"],["sn11.2:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn11.2:2.2","susīmaṃ",0,0],["sn11.2:2.3","susīmaṃ",0,0],["sn11.2:2.4","susīmaṃ",0,0],["sn11.2:2.6","susīmaṃ",0,0],["sn11.2:2.8","susīmaṃ",0,0],["sn11.2:2.10","susīmaṃ",0,0]],"before":[{"para":1412,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Susīmasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":1612,"to":1614,"paras":[{"para":1612,"vripara":"248","refs":["sn11.2:1"],"lines":["<b>Antare</b>ti abbhantare.","<b>Evaṃnāmakan</b>ti “susīmo”ti evaṃnāmakaṃ.","<b>Ekaṃ puttameva</b> aññataraṃ attano puttameva."],"lineRefs":[["sn11.2:1"],["sn11.2:1"],["sn11.2:1"]]},{"para":1613,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn11.2:1"],"lines":["Susīmasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn11.2:1"]]},{"para":1614,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn11.2:1"],"lines":["Dhajaggasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn11.2:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":1610,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Suvīrasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1611,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Susīmasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika2":null}
